  "label": "Textual entity 'me' mapped onto the children in striped uniforms",
  "description": "The text 'when i needed medical attention and doctor mengele was there for me' implies that the speaker (the 'me' in the text) is one of the children depicted in the image. The visual material of the children, who are suffering and in concentration camp attire, is being mapped onto the textual entity 'me' to create a grotesque and hateful analogy where the speaker falsely claims to have been helped by a Nazi perpetrator.",
